3387240","kind":"announcement","title":"My Fairy Princess– Joins Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Let's witness our daughter's growth together!Thank you for your continued support and interest in our game! My Fairy Princess is confirmed to be part of Steam Next Fest. Come and try the demo!Game IntroductionIn My Fairy Princess, you raise a daughter in a vibrant world of multiple endings. Plan her life and journey beside her through a fabled realm of humans, yaoguai, and immortals. Your choices shape not only the life she leads, but the one she comes to love.Demo is expected to be playable for","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T02:55:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706693503","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3387240-1846651706689623","game_id":"steam-3387240","kind":"update","title":"My Fairy Princess — Demo Update","summary":"Update NotesNew content: 1. Unlocked the Immortal's Seat area, along with the matching outdoor Intellect activities.2. Added the School Year Evaluation system.3. Added the Immortal-Fiend system.4. Made the Talent Tree available.5. Made tailoring, alchemy, and deep-sea fishing lifestyle activities available.6. Added two new Flower Festival mini-games: Pitch Pot and Portrait Guessing.7. Added 4 new romanceable NPCs.8. Added new map story events.9. Added a Quick Challenge feature, letting you gathe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T10:33:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689623","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3387240-1842846814442826","game_id":"steam-3387240","kind":"announcement","title":"My Fairy Princess Demo Is Out Now!","summary":"Hey there, everyone!We've got some huge news to share with you all today!While we were honestly tempted to keep you in suspense a little longer... whoa, hey! Put down the rotten tomatoes! Okay, okay, we'll spill the beans.The big secret is finally out: the My Fairy Princess Demo is officially live right now.Getting to this milestone has been quite a journey, and we truly can't thank you enough for sticking with us, cheering us on, and showing so much love along the way.To our team, this game has","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-03T10:02:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814442826","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3387240-1841579228664116","game_id":"steam-3387240","kind":"announcement","title":"My Fairy Princess Playtest Is Now Live!","summary":"Hi, everyone!The Playtest for My Fairy Princess is now live! Come visit this fabled realm and watch your daughter grow up alongside you!Since this is still a Playtest build, you may run into a few odd little issues that we haven't had a chance to fix yet.But there's a simple reason we wanted to share the game with you at this stage: just like the daughter you raise in the game, the game itself needs your care and attention to grow, one step at a time.Every time you play and every piece of feedba","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-20T02:00:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228664116","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3387240-1824644522843151","game_id":"steam-3387240","kind":"announcement","title":"Happy Lunar New Year~","summary":"Dear friends following our game, Happy New Year!We’re here with a brand-new Lunar New Year illustration to send you our warm greetings!This past year has been quite a rollercoaster for our dev team:we’ve felt overjoyed watching our “little daughter” grow more beautiful each day,and also stressed out thinking “why is there always more work to finish?”Thankfully, we pulled through!We’ve quietly held 2 closed beta tests and taken detailed notes on all your feedback.Now for the big announcement!Afte","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-15T09:58:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1824644522843151","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3387240":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:37:19Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:37:19Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3387240":"2026-10-26T10:37:19Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3387240":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:37:19Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:37:19Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:37:19Z"},"4036120":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:37:19Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:37:19Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:37:19Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3387240","app_id":3387240,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:17Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"f24797934c8e45c4567318668e6a5ab02a978350548def040d877fe7bcb3127c","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"<선향 육아일기>는 동양 선협 세계를 배경으로 한 멀티 엔딩 육성 시뮬레이션 게임입니다. 당신은 아버지 또는 어머니가 되어, 신령스러운 기운이 감도는 무릉도원에서 딸을 키우게 됩니다. 평화로워 보이는 선향의 겉모습 이면에는 가문과 나라, 인간과 요괴, 선과 마의 대립 등 다양한 갈등이 조용히 싹트고 있습니다